    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/3b3eccf9e5888e3c1ff2f4da1033a91d.webp?t=1751490257\" /></div>The rules are simple: one, whoever draws the shortest straw enters first. Two, no lights except your jar of fireflies. And three, whoever finds the complete collection of cards hidden in the house becomes the gang leader. Do you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one problem: a presence roams the place, turning your search into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be quick. Hide. Don\u2019t make a noise. And above all...don\u2019t get caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a game turns into a race for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From\u00a0Octavi Navarro (Thimbleweed Park, Photographs...) and Susanna Granell, creators of the critically acclaimed games <i>The Supper</i>, <i>The Librarian</i>, and the\u00a0<i>Midnight Scenes </i>series<i>,\u00a0</i> comes this weird and peculiar horror game for fans of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/d99eef9d7cf222f564c2533961ab02fd.poster.avif?t=1751490257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/d99eef9d7cf222f564c2533961ab02fd.webm?t=1751490257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/d99eef9d7cf222f564c2533961ab02fd.mp4?t=1751490257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/b3b884a619e214e41e875feb8663843e.webp?t=1751490257\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive horror experience that will keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorgeous combination of 3D environments and pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eerie soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with dozens of objects in a house full of secrets, and discover the truth about its late inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only light source is a jar of fireflies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all the cards hidden in the house before the presence gets you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck!!!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/3b3eccf9e5888e3c1ff2f4da1033a91d.webp?t=1751490257\" /></div>The rules are simple: one, whoever draws the shortest straw enters first. Two, no lights except your jar of fireflies. And three, whoever finds the complete collection of cards hidden in the house becomes the gang leader. Do you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one problem: a presence roams the place, turning your search into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be quick. Hide. Don\u2019t make a noise. And above all...don\u2019t get caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a game turns into a race for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From\u00a0Octavi Navarro (Thimbleweed Park, Photographs...) and Susanna Granell, creators of the critically acclaimed games <i>The Supper</i>, <i>The Librarian</i>, and the\u00a0<i>Midnight Scenes </i>series<i>,\u00a0</i> comes this weird and peculiar horror game for fans of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/d99eef9d7cf222f564c2533961ab02fd.poster.avif?t=1751490257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/d99eef9d7cf222f564c2533961ab02fd.webm?t=1751490257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/d99eef9d7cf222f564c2533961ab02fd.mp4?t=1751490257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838340/extras/b3b884a619e214e41e875feb8663843e.webp?t=1751490257\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive horror experience that will keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorgeous combination of 3D environments and pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eerie soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with dozens of objects in a house full of secrets, and discover the truth about its late inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only light source is a jar of fireflies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all the cards hidden in the house before the presence gets you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck!!!</p>",
